   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">[The Progress of Russian and German Co-operation] (Art.IWM PST 3159) whole: The image fills the majority of the design, with Arabic text in white towards the bottom contained within a black&#xA;rectangular box. The design has a red and black border.&#xA;image: Caricatures of Hitler and Stalin in tattered uniforms, attempt a three legged race. They salute and glare at each&#xA;other.&#xA;text: The Progress of Russian and German Co-operation Copyright: Â© IWM. Original Source: http://www.iwm.org.uk/collections/item/object/15282</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
